cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository or its results, please cite the master's thesis it is part of (preferred citation below)."
title: "5LTEP-L3 · ANEEL instance (control experiment)"
abstract: >-
  Second instance of the 5L-TEP Layer 3 anomaly detection toolkit (5ltep-layer3),
  applied to the infraction notices of ANEEL, Brazil's electricity regulator, as a
  control case for the IBAMA study: the same code, configured only by a declarative
  profile. Set up by the author; not operated by or affiliated with ANEEL. Part of
  the master's thesis cited below.
